        "quote": "(c) All receptacles containing matter or anything whatever which is dangerous or detrimental to the public health shall be provided with flyproof covers, and it shall be unlawful for any person to deposit any of the matter designated in this section in a receptacle in the City unless such receptacle is provided with a flyproof cover. (Ord. 17179 § 1, 10-7-97. Code 1981 § 19-1. Code 1995 § 122-1.)",
